---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Check your inbox | Pranjal Pandey" description="Confirm your email to get the AI Strategy Starter for Founders & Leaders." minimal noindex>
  <div class="wrap"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">One more step</p><h1>Check your inbox.</h1><p class="lead">If you just signed up, look for an email from Pranjal Pandey. Click "Confirm and get the guide" to confirm your subscription and reach the download page.</p></header>
    <div class="reading"><p>Check promotions or spam if you don't see it. Already subscribed? Check your existing welcome email for the guide link.</p><p>This page can't confirm a subscription, email delivery, booking or payment. Opening it alone doesn't complete any of those actions.</p><p>Need help? <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Help%20with%20the%20AI%20Strategy%20Starter`}>Email {site.email}</a>, or <a href="/guide/">return to the guide form</a>.</p><h2>While you wait</h2><p><em>AI for Startups</em>, a deeper playbook for founders, is upcoming and not for sale yet. <a href="/guides/">See the guides</a>.</p><p>Leading a team or company? <a href="/call/">Book a free 30-minute intro call</a>. The guide doesn't require a booking.</p></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
